cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: chiselWare
abstract: >
  chiselWare is a certified open-source ecosystem for professional-grade
  semiconductor IP core development using the Chisel hardware description
  language. It provides a methodology, toolchain, and certification framework
  for creating reusable, high-quality Chisel IP cores including support for
  formal verification via SymbiYosys and Z3.
